Transit data
------------
Live departures and the station directory use data provided by
MTA New York City Transit (https://api.mta.info):
  - GTFS-realtime feeds (api-endpoint.mta.info, no API key required)
  - Stations.csv (web.mta.info/developers, mirrored on data.ny.gov)
Route symbols and line colors are trademarks of the Metropolitan
Transportation Authority; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
the MTA.

